menu "Status Indicator Service Configuration"

    config SVC_STATUS_ENABLE
        bool "Enable device status indicator service"
        default y
        depends on DRV_LED_ENABLE
        help
            Heartbeat LED service. Blinks the status LED periodically to show
            the firmware is running, and exposes the 'led' console command.

    config SVC_STATUS_HEARTBEAT_MS
        int "Heartbeat half-period (ms)"
        default 1000
        depends on SVC_STATUS_ENABLE
        help
            LED toggles every N ms. 1000 ms means a full on/off period of 2 s.

endmenu
